Performance - Virtual thread :
Task involve only CPU ==> No enefit from virtual thread 
Task involves T time to complete IO , even with virtual thread same latency 
Virtual thread => Increase throughput 
Virtual thread => Okay for short and frequent IO calls without context switch         
       But best to batch short IO calls into less frequest and long IO operations 

